  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - Transportation Sector Opportunities, through U.S. Government - Trade and Development Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $65,000 definitional mission evaluated transportation sector opportunities in Brazil. The definitional mission evaluated projects involving SEIL-Parana Infrastructure and Logistics Secretariat, Consorcio ABC-ABC Region Municipal Consortium, SPTrans-Sao Paulo Transportation Secretariat, and CET-Rio-Traffic Engineering Company of Rio de Janeiro, and discussed further opportunities with the Brazilian Association of Highway Concessionaires (ABCR) member concessionaires.</narrative>
  </description>
